# Secrets and local configuration.
# NOTE: a bare `config.py` rule used to live here. It silently swallowed
# modules/m1_segmentation/config.py (which held DB_CONFIG), leaving that
# dashboard importing a name nothing defines. Secrets now live in .env only.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

